  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\lim _{c \\rightarrow 0} \\int_c^x \\frac{b t \\cos 4 t-a \\sin 4 t}{t^2} d t=\\frac{a \\sin 4 x}{x}-1,(0 < x < \\pi / 4)$. Then a and $b$ are given by",
